# secrets/hermes.env — secrets ONLY for the hermes agent.
# Merged on top of common.env when you run: ./sandbox.sh open hermes
# Copy to secrets/hermes.env and fill in. Gitignored.
#
# Hermes reads these from the process environment (see Hermes env-vars docs).
# Keep ONLY secrets here (API keys, bot tokens, OAuth). Non-secret behaviour
# belongs in agents/hermes/config.yaml.

# --- Model provider (pick what you use) ---
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
# GEMINI_API_KEY=...
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=...

# With BROKER_ENABLED=true and the default Hermes broker settings,
# OPENAI_API_KEY is passed only to LiteLLM. Hermes receives a short-lived
# broker token through OPENAI_API_KEY instead.

# --- Nous Portal (if using hermes setup --portal) ---
# (OAuth is browser-based; usually no key needed here)

# --- Tool APIs (only if you enable those tools) ---
# FIRECRAWL_API_KEY=...
# TAVILY_API_KEY=...
# BRAVE_SEARCH_API_KEY=...
